# core.autocrlf=true is set on Windows checkouts. Git only skips line-ending
# conversion for files it *guesses* are binary (a NUL byte in the first 8 KiB).
# Be explicit for the media we keep in the repo, or one day a clip without an
# early NUL gets its bytes rewritten and silently corrupted.
*.mp4  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
